  "html": "<p>A glossary of in-game terms.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Glossary\"</h2>\n<p>There are 68 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abbreviations\" title=\"Abbreviations\">Abbreviations</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agility\" title=\"Agility\">Agility</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Area_of_Effect\" title=\"Area of Effect\">Area of Effect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Armor\" title=\"Armor\">Armor</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rating\" title=\"Attack Rating\">Attack Rating</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attributes\" title=\"Attributes\">Attributes</a></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bank\" title=\"Bank\">Bank</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Build\" title=\"Build\">Build</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Build_%28Character%29\" title=\"Build (Character)\">Build (Character)</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Champion\" title=\"Champion\">Champion</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Class\" title=\"Class\">Class</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Couch_Potato\" title=\"Couch Potato\">Couch Potato</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curses</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Over_Time\" title=\"Damage Over Time\">Damage Over Time</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_per_Second\" title=\"Damage per Second\">Damage per Second</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Penalty\" title=\"Death Penalty\">Death Penalty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Rating\" title=\"Defense Rating\">Defense Rating</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dev\" title=\"Dev\">Dev</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty\" title=\"Difficulty\">Difficulty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeons</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Endurance\" title=\"Endurance